{
  "slug": "cloud-coder",
  "name": "Cloud Coder",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Autonomous overnight coding agent. Queue tasks in YAML, run them via Claude CLI while you sleep, and use self-healing audit-fix loops to hit any quality target. Includes skills for task queue management, continuous audit-fix cycles, and progress monitoring.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `audit-loop` (Run a continuous audit-fix-audit loop that scores a codebase and automatically fixes gaps until a target score is…), `check-progress` (Check the progress of running Cloud Coder tasks), `run-queue` (Create and run an autonomous overnight task queue)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cloud-coder@claude-community` from `VadneyK/cloud-coder`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
